# Tailscale auth key that `fleet bootstrap` uses to join each new VPS to your tailnet.
# The real file lives only on your home machine: ~/.config/fleet/secrets/tailscale.env
#
# Create it at https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys > Generate auth key:
#   Reusable: on   Ephemeral: off   Pre-approved: on   Tags: tag:fleet
# (add tag:fleet to your access policy first: home/tailscale-policy.example.hujson)
# You only need it while you set VPSs up. It expires after the number of days you
# pick (90 at most); make a new one if you add a VPS later.
TS_AUTHKEY=
